===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|final}}, {{m|enm|fynal}}, {{m|enm|fynall}}, from {{der|en|fro|final}}, from {{der|en|la|fīnālis|t=of or relating to the end or to boundaries}}, from {{m|la|fīnis||end}}; see [[fine]]. Replaced native English {{m|en|endly||final}}.

